{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Humanity collapsed centuries ago, nuclear wars followed by a zombie apocalypse destroyed almost every human outpost. You're a survivor.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Discover a continent consisting of procedural generated lands with multiple biomes based on the southern Andes Mountains and a hand crafted island in the middle of the Pacific Ocean.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >SURVIVE AND GEAR UP</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Improve your stats by hunting monsters and choosing skills to upgrade, buy new weapons and vehicles that will help you explore and survive.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3781420/extras/c427ee4929707b73667d9fb26b91ee19.avif?t=1764854104\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3781420/extras_big/c427ee4929707b73667d9fb26b91ee19.webp?t=1764854104 width=1560 height=257 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >THE  ISLAND</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Discover a hand-crafted Island far from the nuclear missiles reach that once served a safe zone.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3781420/extras/c6a5a5e4e15b339e23b257b8b2cdf55c.avif?t=1764854104\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3781420/extras_big/c6a5a5e4e15b339e23b257b8b2cdf55c.webp?t=1764854104 width=1560 height=257 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3781420/extras/4d5d656a475f018e16708f1fe81e23de.avif?t=1764854104\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3781420/extras_big/4d5d656a475f